    "summary": "Female figure carved from elephant ivory with a stylized head with large eyes, broad nose, mouth with teeth and decorated with fine circular motifs across the top of the head and on both cheeks. The neck is finely carved with a band of zig-zags and is further decorated with a series of holes in a zig-zag design. The torso is decorated with small hole and has an extended belly button. Both arms have a band of finely carved zig-zags. The legs have similar bands with a &#039;V&#039; shaped addition. There are two small holes to the base of the left foot.",
